  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(19 fotos) Julio Segura, chef del restaurante El M&oacute;n de Julio, ha repetido nuevamente este mi&eacute;rcoles en la sesiones mensuales de &#39;Cocina en directo&#39; en el Mercado Municipal de Onda</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">, dentro del plan de dinamizaci&oacute;n que el Ayuntamiento ha encargado a la C&aacute;mara de Comercio de Castell&oacute;n.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0621.jpg\" alt=\"img_0621\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0622.jpg\" alt=\"img_0622\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0623.jpg\" alt=\"img_0623\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0624.jpg\" alt=\"img_0624\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0625.jpg\" alt=\"img_0625\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0627.jpg\" alt=\"img_0627\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0630.jpg\" alt=\"img_0630\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0632.jpg\" alt=\"img_0632\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cuinaendirectemercatonda/img_0635.jpg\" alt=\"img_06